<title>VENEZUELA: Electricidad H1 net edges higher.</title>
<headline>Electricidad H1 net edges higher.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr n/a</p>
<p>Net 27.172 billion bolivars vs 25.078 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Sales 118.151 billion bolivars vs 125.932 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Oper income 24.198 billion bolivars vs 34.627 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Six month period ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Results expressed in June 30, 1997 constant bolivars.</p>
<p>CA Electricidad de Caracas SACA is the chief distributor of energy  in the Venezuelan capital and the bellwether stock on the Caracas  Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
